      "Anna is Lily's cousin. She is at Lily's house. \"Hello, Anna!\" says Lily. \"Hello, Lily!\" says Anna. Dad has the food. It is on the table.",
      "\"Egg, please,\" says Anna. \"Here you are,\" says Dad. \"Thank you!\" says Anna. \"Fruit, please,\" says Tom. Oh! Tom hits Anna's arm. \"Sorry!\" says Tom. \"Don't worry,\" says Anna.",
      "Lily has an egg and fruit. It is good food. Is it a good breakfast? Yes, it is! Then Anna's dad is here. \"Goodbye, Anna!\" says Lily. \"Goodbye! See you!\" says Anna."
